Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.82,0:23:13.82,ED,,0,0,0,,你的笑容闪耀
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.82,0:23:18.82,ED,,0,0,0,,无论多远
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.82,0:23:23.82,ED,,0,0,0,,多远的距离
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.82,0:23:28.82,ED,,0,0,0,,我们都在迎接
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.82,0:23:34.82,ED,,0,0,0,,相同的早晨
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.82,0:23:39.52,ED,,0,0,0,,闪亮的 闪耀着的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.52,0:23:44.82,ED,,0,0,0,,回忆 维系上
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.82,0:23:49.82,ED,,0,0,0,,未来的 未来的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.82,0:23:54.82,ED,,0,0,0,,神大人也在
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.82,0:24:00.82,ED,,0,0,0,,神大人也在
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.96,0:01:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,（闹钟铃声）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.72,0:01:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,（光希）嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.48,0:01:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,（按下停止按钮的声音）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.40,0:01:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,今天是星期天 不用叫了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.82,0:01:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,哈…电话！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.20,0:02:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,（拨号音）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.37,0:02:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,（呼叫音）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.08,0:02:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,（呼叫音）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.97,0:02:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,（接电话的声音）啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.93,0:02:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,（威尔）Hello Will和Yuu现在出去了…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.35,0:02:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,又是留言？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.18,0:02:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,（信号音）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.06,0:02:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我是光希 回来后给我打电话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.98,0:02:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,无论如何都想听到游的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.61,0:02:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,（挂电话的声音）已经…不走运了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.24,0:02:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.90,0:02:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会输的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.00,0:02:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们走了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.50,0:02:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,请关好门
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.55,0:02:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,好期待啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.55,0:03:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我想看那部电影
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.76,0:03:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都出去了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.81,0:03:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我今天在铃家打工
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.06,0:03:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,一起出门吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.14,0:03:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起我今天上早班
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.38,0:03:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你还在生那件事的气吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.34,0:03:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我以后不会再拉你了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.51,0:03:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,（电话铃声）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.22,0:03:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,出来！我出来！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.22,0:03:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我是小石川
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.81,0:03:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,啊？海鲜披萨L？我们不是披萨店！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.02,0:04:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯……什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.86,0:04:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,（来电音）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.08,0:04:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,（信号音）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.75,0:04:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,哈罗威尔和游现在出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.88,0:04:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,请留言（信号音）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.21,0:04:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,（挂电话的声音）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.88,0:04:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,对面是晚上8点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.93,0:04:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,干脆挂在宿舍看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.26,0:04:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,现在的话不麻烦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.81,0:04:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,（拨号音）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.15,0:04:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,（学生）哈哈哈…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.15,0:04:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,亚历克斯 你的状态太好了（电话铃声）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.40,0:04:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,（亚历克斯）嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.86,0:04:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,（呼叫音）（Alex）Hello
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.36,0:04:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…那个…叫光希·鲤鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.95,0:04:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,有松露吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.24,0:04:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,啊游？如果是他 我会去布莱恩的别墅
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.79,0:04:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,布莱恩的别墅？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.08,0:04:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,长岛的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.79,0:05:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,现在和吉尼他们玩得很开心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.63,0:05:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,「吉尼」？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.13,0:05:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,明晚再打电话给我好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.30,0:05:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,吉尼是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.27,0:05:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,在那边马上交女朋友的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.85,0:05:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,吉尼是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.48,0:05:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你在听吗？喂？喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.44,0:05:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,那个！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.86,0:06:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了！我赢了！又被打了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.36,0:06:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,今天不走运
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.57,0:06:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,来点曲奇怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.87,0:06:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我在家里烤的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.49,0:06:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.45,0:06:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,多丽丝的饼干是最好吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.91,0:06:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.92,0:06:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,（杏树）那我给你倒杯咖啡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.96,0:06:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我会帮你的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.38,0:06:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我上去一下（威尔）啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.07,0:06:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,多丽丝？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.86,0:06:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,（叹气）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.93,0:07:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,（电话铃声）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.94,0:07:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,（电话铃声）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.31,0:07:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,（游）…至少给我留个电话吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.11,0:07:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,（脚步声）嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.45,0:07:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,吉尼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.08,0:07:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,给东京的女朋友打电话？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.21,0:07:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,果然
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.00,0:07:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的很在意她
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.42,0:07:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,（吉尼）但是大家一起来玩的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.38,0:07:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,如果忘了她？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.76,0:07:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,与你无关吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.18,0:07:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,有关系啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.72,0:08:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然她在远方 但我就在游面前！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.20,0:08:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,游不知道真正的爱情是什么样的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.20,0:08:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,忘了她吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.87,0:08:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.25,0:08:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.17,0:08:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么不接受我的心情呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.42,0:08:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.63,0:08:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,什么好孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.55,0:08:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,那个女朋友也在游不在的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.14,0:08:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你可能和别的孩子在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.93,0:08:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,做了什么仗义之类的事 像笨蛋一样！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.73,0:08:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,光希不是那样的家伙（吉尼）诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.19,0:08:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,如果再侮辱光希的话
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.86,0:08:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的会讨厌你的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.28,0:08:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.87,0:09:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,吉尼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.96,0:09:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,2楼吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.05,0:09:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,吉尼怎么了？吉尼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.36,0:09:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你对吉尼做了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.69,0:09:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.65,0:09:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你说谎 吉尼的样子可不寻常
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.28,0:09:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都没做 你不喜欢吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.12,0:09:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.08,0:09:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,对她有好感吧？你要抓紧一点
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.75,0:09:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.91,0:10:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,吉尼？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.79,0:10:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你呆呆地站着 多丽丝
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.71,0:10:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你也跳吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.80,0:10:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,住手 吉尼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.80,0:10:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊 难得的周末 我们得尽情享受
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.39,0:10:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,大家尽情地跳舞吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.33,0:11:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,吉尼…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.66,0:12:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,吉尼 你！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.04,0:12:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,布赖恩 我们跳舞吧 今晚没人会让你睡着的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.00,0:12:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道自己在做什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.46,0:12:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,哇…好痛啊！干什么？我不记得你指使我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.97,0:12:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.30,0:12:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,（音乐停止的声音）啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.39,0:12:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.90,0:12:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,吉尼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.27,0:12:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你不要这样伤害自己
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.99,0:12:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,哇…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.03,0:12:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,吉尼！放开我！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.83,0:12:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 周末到了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.52,0:13:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,（狗叫声）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.62,0:13:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你们是好朋友吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.71,0:13:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不管有多少男孩子对我发火
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.46,0:13:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,如果不被自己爱的唯一的人爱就没有意义了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.88,0:13:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.30,0:13:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,（叫声）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.51,0:13:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起不要在意
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.97,0:13:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.22,0:13:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,（男性）爱因斯坦！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.64,0:13:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.99,0:14:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你要睡到什么时候？我会感冒的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.45,0:14:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.08,0:14:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,多丽丝
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.17,0:14:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不赶紧来的话 重新放的咖啡会凉的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.42,0:14:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你的饼干男们盯上了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.72,0:14:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.85,0:14:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我走了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.19,0:14:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.51,0:15:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢大家
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.68,0:15:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,（叹气）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.19,0:15:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,在那边马上交女朋友的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.82,0:15:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,现在和吉尼他们玩得很开心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.16,0:15:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,「吉尼」？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.99,0:15:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.80,0:15:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不打起精神的话
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.51,0:15:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,因为会让黎小姐担心 所以我只是努力看看而已
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.09,0:15:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,果然很累
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.14,0:15:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,（开门声）（光希）啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.22,0:15:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎光临
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.39,0:15:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,银太亚梨实
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.40,0:16:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.69,0:16:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,还算好的约会？啊呀呀…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.15,0:16:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,今天是亚梨实送给朋友的生日礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.53,0:16:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我想在这里寻找
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.32,0:16:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这种事在社会上叫做约会
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.78,0:16:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,也可以这么说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.95,0:16:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,在找什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.16,0:16:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,古董胸针什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.58,0:16:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,如果有不太贵的就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.59,0:16:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,那有正好的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.01,0:16:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,这个怎么样？（亚梨实）哇 太棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.89,0:16:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得哪个好？嗯……是啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.14,0:16:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊银太和亚梨实总是两个人在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.99,0:16:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,（电子音）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.11,0:16:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,哦！这周的财运非常好（亚梨实）啊！是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.49,0:16:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,那么今天就期待吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.16,0:17:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不 今天真糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.50,0:17:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？生物节律？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.17,0:17:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,好的谢谢找零
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.21,0:17:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,光希也试试看？怎么做？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.63,0:17:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样…（光希）嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.51,0:17:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,（电子音）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.89,0:17:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,（银太）喔…喔…（电子音）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.94,0:17:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.60,0:17:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.85,0:17:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,恋爱的生物节奏很好（光希）诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.15,0:17:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.28,0:17:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-再见-再见
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.86,0:17:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.37,0:17:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,一定是我想得太多了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.79,0:17:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,游是不可能交女朋友的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.88,0:17:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克尔老师 吃晚饭就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.47,0:17:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我想去接光希
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.05,0:17:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,「来接我」是那个进口杂货店吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.01,0:17:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,那样的话铃也想去！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.98,0:18:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,那里有非常漂亮的盘子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.60,0:18:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我想买那个（迈克尔）OK一起去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.98,0:18:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.66,0:18:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,和迈克尔光希在那之后怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.62,0:18:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,啊？「怎么样」？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.83,0:18:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系 光希就算拿了 游里也有铃
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.29,0:18:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.04,0:18:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…但是拿光希的是——
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.46,0:18:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,也有叫萤的有力候补啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.55,0:18:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,萤？萤那种家伙我压根没放在眼里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.01,0:18:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你说谁没放在眼里 （迈克尔）嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.39,0:18:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,萤君（迈克尔）萤！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.02,0:18:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,光希差不多可以上去了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.81,0:18:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,但是整理好之后
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.23,0:18:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,光希！小铃
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.69,0:18:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,光希小姐辛苦了！迈克尔和萤吵架了…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.41,0:18:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.49,0:19:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,不管你说什么 我一定要夺的光希的心！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.41,0:19:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,真是个不懂的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.62,0:19:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,在男朋友不在的时候很好地插队
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.25,0:19:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,光希的心是无法抓住的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.05,0:19:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么？你在我的哪里发呆？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.22,0:19:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.81,0:19:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.64,0:19:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.86,0:19:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,等等！别这样！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.94,0:19:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,（打中的声音）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.49,0:19:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…（迈克尔）妈的…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.78,0:19:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的话 我来决定！（萤）笨蛋！放开我！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.70,0:19:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,小萤你在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.75,0:19:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我会让你再也不去管光希的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.42,0:19:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.13,0:19:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,两个人都不要！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.09,0:20:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,漂亮的男孩子们互相争夺恋人真是太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.39,0:20:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,住手！拜托了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.90,0:20:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.11,0:20:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,如果不住手的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.74,0:20:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.71,0:20:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢的是…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.63,0:20:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢的是…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.75,0:20:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,只是游
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.05,0:20:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,（眼泪落下的声音）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.09,0:20:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,只有游而已！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.27,0:20:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,（哭声）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.77,0:20:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,游…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.78,0:20:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,游…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.82,0:20:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,游…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.82,0:21:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,游！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.12,0:21:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,游！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.54,0:21:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,（茗子）光希！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.95,0:21:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,（哭声）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.12,0:21:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,茗子…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.83,0:21:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,茗子！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.79,0:21:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了？发生了什么事？光希
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.26,0:21:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我…已经不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.89,0:21:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,想和游…游见面！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.48,0:21:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,（哭声）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.69,0:21:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,光希…（哭声）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.65,0:21:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,去纽约吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.20,0:21:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,在广岛 名村老师和我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.82,0:21:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,能够互相确认彼此心意的是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.16,0:21:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,多亏了光希
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.79,0:21:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这次让我回礼吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.00,0:21:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,一起去见松浦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.84,0:21:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,茗子…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.09,0:22:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,在纽约？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.09,0:22:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,去见游…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.28,0:22:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我想见游！想见你确认我们的心情
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.28,0:22:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,已经讨厌分离的单向通行的生活！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.91,0:22:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,吉尼？为什么你会从游的房间里出来？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.29,0:22:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我的身体冻僵了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.34,0:22:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,橘子酱男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.67,0:22:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,「N.Y（纽约）的陷阱」「游 我是笨蛋吗？」